{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of space, enemy forces are swarming toward your base.<br>As commander, you must build and upgrade defensive installations within limited space and resources to withstand wave after wave of attackers. A dynamic tower-defense experience: enemies won't charge blindly \u2014 they detect, warn, and try to bypass your defenses, forcing you to constantly adapt your deployments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied towers: towers with different functions can be combined freely to craft the strategy best suited to repel the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic map design: each map features unique routes and nodes, and your choices directly affect the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating challenge: as waves progress, enemies grow stronger and smarter \u2014 you must upgrade your technology to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense space atmosphere: with sci-fi visuals and immersive audio, the combat experience is intense and gripping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, placing a single tower won't guarantee victory \u2014 you must think globally and respond flexibly. Only the wisest commanders will hold the last line of defense.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Launch the Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975220/ab9ee1b492f9c9646ad59d6cf121a7555bdd7c4e.jpg"},{"name":"Second Lieutenant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975220/ee749857408a9d19b0aca1ce9ef23282c0ed5d8b.jpg"},{"name":"First Lieutenant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975220/2eacd755ba89cc1585ead586bb885e500361a7d6.jpg"},{"name":"Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975220/3cdd2e777b2ab4eec63ef921b386d38fe22dfd62.jpg"},{"name":"Major","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975220/6632a