indly \u2014 they detect, warn, and try to bypass your defenses, forcing you to constantly adapt your deployments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied towers: towers with different functions can be combined freely to craft the strategy best suited to repel the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic map design: each map features unique routes and nodes, and your choices directly affect the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating challenge: as waves progress, enemies grow stronger and smarter \u2014 you must upgrade your technology to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense space atmosphere: with sci-fi visuals and immersive audio, the combat experience is intense and gripping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, placing a single tower won't guarantee victory \u2014 you must think globally and respond flexibly. Only the wisest commanders will hold the last line of defense.</p>","developers":["KKDM"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975220/56faed87e6d0766abc2a0cfd3d726855912790d3/header.jpg?t=1773069363","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975220/354619983/e6703fafe3a32c10f922350e4e4995388f2897b0/1768637402/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768641004","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975220/354619983/e6703fafe3a32c10f922350e4e4995388f2897b0/1768637402/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768641004","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975220/354619983/e6703fafe3a32c10f922350e4e4995388f2897b0/1768